desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "csharp"
	title: "Struct scan: C# Html.Raw"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：C# Html.Raw"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "struct-csharp-html-raw"
	risk: "xss"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 Html.Raw。会关闭 HTML 转义。

### 风险类型
xss

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学配置，可能被用于绕过校验、执行代码或泄露机密。

### 检测方式
结构扫描在编译单元内匹配真实调用，而不是注释或字符串字面量。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
只对已消毒内容使用 Html.Raw。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://X.cs": <<<POS
class X { object Bad(string s) { return Html.Raw(s); } class Html { public static object Raw(string s){ return s; } } }

POS
	"safefile://S.cs": <<<NEG
class S { void Ok() {} }

NEG
)

Html.Raw as $call
Html.Raw(* as $s) as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Struct scan: C# Html.Raw",
	title_zh: "结构扫描：C# Html.Raw",
	message: "结构扫描：C# Html.Raw",
	risk: "xss",
}
